  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance component of the EFSD &#xbf;InclusiFI&#xbf; Proposed Investment Program (PIP) - Sub-Saharan countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The main objective of the Program is to contribute to reduce inequality and increase job creation and income generation, by fostering entrepreneurship and closing the financing gap for MSMEs in Sub-Saharan countries. The goal is to leverage private financing to foster inclusive and sustainable entrepreneurship and MSMEs growth, ideally through remittances and diaspora capital, by expanding innovative business development and financial services in selected countries.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
